        "query": "-- The email provider connected to the order's site; no row is written if there is none.\nINSERT INTO leadgen.provider_records (order_id, provider_id, type, external_id)\nSELECT o.id, pr.id, 'email_verification', $2\nFROM leadgen.orders o\nJOIN leadgen.site_providers sp ON sp.site_id = o.site_id AND sp.active\nJOIN leadgen.providers pr ON pr.id = sp.provider_id AND pr.active AND pr.type = 'email'\nWHERE o.id = $1\nON CONFLICT (order_id, type) DO NOTHING",
